      <text><![CDATA[<p>Alignment of bivalent chromosomes along the equatorial plate through spindle fibres to both poles</p>]]></text>
    </answer>
    <answer fraction="100" format="html">
      <text><![CDATA[<p>Simultaneous splitting of centromeres and migration of separated sister chromatids towards opposite poles with centromeres leading</p>]]></text>
    </answer>
    <answer fraction="0" format="html">
      <text><![CDATA[<p>Initiation of chromatin condensation with movement of centrosomes towards opposite poles</p>]]></text>
    </answer>
    <answer fraction="0" format="html">
      <text><![CDATA[<p>Chromosomes cluster at opposite spindle poles and decondense, losing their individual discrete identity</p>]]></text>
    </answer>
